
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For hair and beauty salons</span>
        <h1>Fill your chair, not your DMs.</h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--phone" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/phone-chat.webp?v=1" alt="" width="600" height="1005" /></figure>
        <p class="lead">Every &ldquo;how much for a cut and colour?&rdquo; and &ldquo;any space Saturday?&rdquo; answered in seconds, from your own prices and open slots, while you&rsquo;re busy with a client.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-salons-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="live-demo?sample=enquiries" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-salons-demo">See it answer one</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="painTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Where the day goes</span><h2 id="painTitle">The messages that eat your day.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 1 4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11V9a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><path d="m7 23-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg></span><h3>The same questions all day</h3><p>Prices, hours, &ldquo;do you do&hellip;?&rdquo;. Most messages need the same few answers, typed again between clients.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg></span><h3>Bookings lost while you work</h3><p>You can&rsquo;t reply mid-colour. By the time you can, they&rsquo;ve booked somewhere else.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18M10 14l4 4M14 14l-4 4"/></svg></span><h3>No-shows and gaps</h3><p>Reminders and &ldquo;we have a gap at 2pm&rdquo; messages that never get sent because nobody has the time.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="setTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we&rsquo;d set up</span>
          <h2 id="setTitle">AI drafts the reply. You stay in charge.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Replies drafted from your price list, services and open slots</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Booking requests offered real times from your diary</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Anything unusual, a complaint or a big booking passed to you</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Reminders the day before, so fewer no-shows</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: a simple website with prices, gallery and a Book button</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">It answers only from your own prices and rules. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure about goes to a person.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="industry-demos">
          <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="live-demo?sample=enquiries">
            <div class="work-card__body">
              <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Sample work, nothing is sent</span></div>
              <h3>A Saturday booking, answered</h3>
              <p>A client asks for gel nails on Saturday. The reply offers the open slots and the price, ready to send.</p>
              <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">Run it yourself</span></div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">A fixed price before anything starts.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <div class="reveal">
            <ul class="price-list">
            <li><div class="pl-name">WhatsApp and enquiry assistant<small>Replies drafted from your prices and diary, on WhatsApp and your website. Then from <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo to keep it running (3-month minimum, then month to month)</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Lots of customer email (20+ a day)? Inbox Assistant<small>Routine email replies drafted for your team. <span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup + <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span>/mo, with a <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit to start, refunded in full if it doesn&rsquo;t save 5 hours a week</small></div><span class="price"><small>setup</small><span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Add a website<small>Prices, gallery, Book and WhatsApp buttons</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:.8rem">40% deposit, the rest at go-live. It drafts replies to your real messages before it goes live, and you can stop after any stage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="industry-side">
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>Not sure it&rsquo;s worth it?</h3>
            <p>That&rsquo;s what the free call is for. Tell us roughly how many messages and calls you get. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI would save real hours, and if not, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:.6rem">Only a few messages a day? We&rsquo;ll say so on the call. WhatsApp Business quick replies and an away message may be all you need, and they&rsquo;re free.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical salons. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From first call to answered messages.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps steps--4 reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free 30-minute call</h3><p>You tell us what comes in and what eats your day. We say honestly whether AI fits.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>Exactly what it will do and what it costs. Nothing starts until you&rsquo;ve said yes.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Tested on real messages</h3><p>It drafts replies to your real enquiries first, so you see it working before it goes live.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Running, and measured</h3><p>We look after it and send you the time it saved each month.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions salons ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it reply by itself?</summary><p>Only if you want it to. We start with drafts: the reply is written, you glance at it and press send. Routine answers can go out by themselves later, if you switch that on.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Will it get my prices wrong?</summary><p>It answers only from the price list and rules you give us. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure about is left for you, never guessed.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I keep my WhatsApp number?</summary><p>Yes. It works on your existing WhatsApp Business number, and you can still read and reply on your phone as usual.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I still need a website?</summary><p>Not to start. If you want one, a salon site with prices, gallery and booking is an add-on from <span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span>.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Who will we deal with?</summary><p>A small studio: the person on your free call builds it and answers your messages, with no call centre or hand-offs. It&rsquo;s documented and runs in accounts you own, so any developer can pick it up.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-accountants">Accounting & professional firms</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">Plumbers & trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">Cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For hair and beauty salons</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Tell us what takes too long.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call on Google Meet, or we phone you. You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-salons-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__alt">Rather we phone you? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-call-open>Pick a time</button> &middot; Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in two lines</button></p>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
